 51	/**
 52	 * Simulated payment gateway (D9, G2-12). It resolves with the outcome the person chose after
 53	 * `PAYMENT_DELAY_MS`. No request of any kind is made (REQ-03.20), there is no randomness and no
 54	 * card data. Aborting (the person left the summary) rejects with an `AbortError` and the pending
 55	 * result is discarded (REQ-03.22).
